      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "3",
          "section": "Results",
          "quote": "Nano-scale spherical B2-NiAl precipitates are observed in both 1200 °C and 1000 °C heat-treatment conditions. To further assess the A2 to B2 solvus, the compositions of both phases were measured in the Cr-5Ni-5Al alloy after ageing at 1200 °C for 20 h, giving 97.8Cr-1.3Ni-0.9Al (A2) and 4.8Cr-52.7Ni-42.5Al (B2) by STEM/EDS.",
